WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:08.720
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:15.230
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.060
It's my day!

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:27.640
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:35.050
and head out to see her right now

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:42.420
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:49.830
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:55.600
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:02.740
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:10.250
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:16.390
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:19.460
I just want to walk

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:22.990
Not on tip-toe

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:26.960
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:35.870
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:42.310
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:44.580
It's my day!

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.720
As your fiancé... I'll tame you!

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:52.820
She did it...

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.190
<i>No way!</i>

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:06.740
You know... I like you!

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:36.430
"Love Triangle from Hell!"

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.650
<i>She likes him? Domyoji?</i>

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.470
Since we're getting married anyway...

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:03.590
...I suppose I can
fall in love with you.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:05.600
Married?

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.200
You <i>can</i> fall in love?

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:11.760
Yeah.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:15.730
Uh-oh!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.780
Tsukasa, don't hit her.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.440
Yeah. She's a girl, you know.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.380
You know I wouldn't hit a girl!
Let go of me!

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.040
There's nothing I'd believe less than that!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.010
How many times have you
lied about stuff like that?

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.650
Hey! You!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.160
Don't call me "you."
My name's Shigeru.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.090
So what?!
Who cares what your name is?

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:42.030
I have no attention of marrying,
much less falling in love with you!

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:45.500
You mean "intention," don't you?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.870
- Let me go!
- Makino, take her away somewhere.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.940
- Let go of me!
- Hurry up!

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.710
Hey! Wait!
I need to talk to you!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:05.680
Hey! I said <i>wait!</i>

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.000
Makino!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.840
- <i>Is he stupid or what?!</i>
- Wait a minute!

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.450
<i>He can drop dead for all I care!</i>

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:16.230
<i>I don't want to be involved.
It no longer concerns me!</i>

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.220
They're chummy enough
to be nibbling each other's ears...

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:21.930
<i>And he dares to try
to make excuses...</i>

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:27.550
COUNT DOMYOJI

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:29.840
<i>You've got to be kidding!</i>

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:31.110
Hi!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.950
W-what is it?
Where'd you come from?

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.690
How about going for some tea?

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:43.450
T-tea?

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.190
No thanks. I have class...

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.300
Come on... Let's go.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:53.300
No thanks.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.160
Don't say that.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.230
Come on. Please...

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.640
Pretty please? I'm thirsty...

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.950
Please, please, please?

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.840
<i>What's with this girl?
Is she a ninja?</i>

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:09.890
Let's go!

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.660
The exit's not that way.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.420
You go out the front gate
when you cut class?

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.290
No, I...

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.460
Here. Wear this...

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.740
<i>Is all this really necessary?</i>

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.080
<i>Here I am, after all.</i>

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:51.420
<i>These rich people...
Why are they all so self-centered?</i>

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:57.920
Mmm... This is delicious!
I can feel it throughout my body.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:01.970
It's delicious!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.730
See! Aren't you glad you came?

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:08.300
I'm just thirsty from doing all that!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.840
But wasn't it fun?
Like playing detectives...

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.970
Fun...?

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:17.320
You forced me to come!

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:22.290
As they say, "You're sillier than a rat,
to fight over tea."

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.450
<i>Is she trying to say I'm a rat?</i>

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.420
Where does that saying
come from?

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:31.370
I just made it up.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.160
<i>This girl is really weird!</i>

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.130
<i>No wonder she likes Domyoji.</i>

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.350
I go to Eirin Academy.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:45.610
Oh, that elite girls' school?

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.810
Yeah... They're all no fun at all.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.640
There isn't anyone as funny
as you, there.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.030
<i>Damn her!</i>

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:58.780
What's your name?
Your first name?

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.530
Tsukushi...

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.950
Why, that's such a cute name!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.760
Tell me. What do you think
of Domyoji, Tsukushi?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.560
<i>Here it comes!</i>

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:15.970
<i>She just wanted the scoop.
And she went right to first names...</i>

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.890
There's absolutely nothing going on
between Tsukasa and me...

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.270
...so you needn't worry.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.240
That's not what I'm asking.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.630
Is he good at sex?

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.510
I-I wouldn't know anything
about that.

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:36.050
Well, this is important.
We're getting married, after all.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.860
Why ask me?
You could just try him out!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.360
After all, you've been biting his ear.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.910
Yeah... well, his ears do
seem sensitive.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:47.130
<i>Sensitive?</i>

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:51.100
Actually, I...

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.600
I've never been truly in love.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:03.510
I figured I'd end up
in a marriage of convenience.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:10.090
I was so sure my parents would bring me
a spoiled little rich boy.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.460
But Domyoji's not bad.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.390
He's got class, but
he's rough around the edges.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:20.090
He's a breath of fresh air.

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:26.570
I thought, maybe my life won't
be so bad, after all.

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.600
<i>Hmm...</i>

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.770
<i>I guess an heiress
has problems of her own...</i>

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:38.850
I've decided to have myself
a real love affair.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.320
<i>And why do I have to get
involved in this?</i>

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.800
Why don't you go ahead and
do what you want?

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:52.260
It has absolutely nothing
to do with me!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.550
<i>Oh... I guess that was
pretty mean of me.</i>

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:15.920
<i>She might think
I'm picking on her.</i>

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.420
Er... I mean...

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:20.670
I see...

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.090
You're right.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:26.190
I'm an only child,
so I tend to be self-centered.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.680
That's why I can't make friends.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.030
I'm causing you trouble, aren't I?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.940
Just a little. You're not much trouble.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:42.810
Really?!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.040
Yes...

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.650
Then you'll help me?

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.780
All right, I will.

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:51.120
<i>Huh? Help her?</i>

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.950
Hurray! I'm so happy! Yay!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.880
Yay? But wait...

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.660
This has been my dream.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:09:59.990
Just a minute...

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.660
It's like something
in a novel or drama...

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:06.560
The girl talks over her problems
with her friend.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:10.900
I've always wanted to do that.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:18.040
I'm <i>so</i> happy!
Thanks for your help!

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.010
It's nothing...

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.320
<i>This isn't right...</i>

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.610
I want to fall in love!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:09.830
I love you.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.430
I'll help you.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:17.900
<i>What a weird diagram!
Like a love triangle from hell!</i>

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:20.640
Uh... but...

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:23.070
Hey! What's this?

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.330
This is fun!

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:28.580
W-When did she...?!

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:32.600
Where did you get this?
I want one too.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:36.780
Well, uh... I got it from Domyoji in Canada,
so I don't know...

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:42.590
Canada?
You went with him? To ski?

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:45.750
<i>I really can't help her.
I've got to tell her.</i>

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.520
What's wrong?

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:53.660
Well... I don't know how
to say this, but...

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:54.830
Yes?

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:58.460
I... uh...

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:07.440
Domyoji once told me...
he loved me...

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.910
Really?
But you don't love him, do you?

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.470
No, not at all.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:20.360
Then there's no problem.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.870
You'll turn him towards me, and
make him forget you.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:24.590
- Two birds with one stone!
- Ow!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:43.340
<i>Two birds with one stone...</i>

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:54.420
<i>Is that really it?</i>

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:59.390
<i>I've decided to have myself
a real love affair.</i>

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:04.260
<i>Is falling in love such an easy thing?</i>

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.300
<i>It's not easy for me.</i>

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:17.440
<i>But, oh well...</i>

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.440
<i>It has nothing to do with me.</i>

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:43.030
<i>Love?</i>

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.510
<i>Thanks to Domyoji,</i>

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.610
<i>I'm being drawn into
an even more confusing situation.</i>

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:04.890
<i>"Love" seems like such
an empty word to me now.</i>

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:09.290
<i>It's like an ocean glittering
in the distance.</i>

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:13.560
<i>I want to touch it,
but it's too shiny and unreachable.</i>

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:29.640
It's too shiny...

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:33.580
What's too shiny?

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.710
Rui Hanazawa!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.120
A bald head?

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.420
N-no... Not a bald head, but love.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:45.090
Love? Love me, love my fish...

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:50.900
Did you just get here?

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:51.560
Yeah...

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:55.700
I don't know why, but I woke up
in the middle of the night.

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:57.840
I couldn't go back to sleep
after that.

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:02.540
I know how it is... You finally fall asleep,
and it's morning.

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.680
My head is so hazy.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.250
Shall I give you a massage?

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.990
I'm pretty good at it.
I do it for my dad sometimes.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.820
Massage? My head?

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.930
That's right.
Haven't you had it done?

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:27.570
Don't. You're so strong,
you might squish my brain.

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:30.600
How rude!
What do I look like, a wrestler?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.340
Ah... That feels good.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:38.810
Doesn't it?

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:47.250
<i>His head is much smaller
than Dad's.</i>

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:55.560
<i>I've come a long way.</i>

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:59.500
<i>To think that I'm massaging
Rui Hanazawa's head...</i>

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:13.780
Beautiful weather, isn't it?

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:15.380
Yeah...

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:20.820
<i>I love this atmosphere...</i>

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:25.250
<i>He has an air about him
that no one else has.</i>

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:29.630
<i>He used to always be so moody.</i>

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.800
<i>I have no interest in other people.</i>

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.670
<i>If anyone dared to get too close...</i>

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:43.540
<i>...he'd act like he's warding you off.</i>

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:49.080
<i>But...</i>

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:50.950
<i>I wanted to see him...</i>

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.510
<i>Wanted to see him...</i>

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:58.820
<i>Even if he hurt my feelings...
so I'd come to this emergency exit.</i>

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:20.750
<i>He sent a breeze into my gray life...</i>

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:25.510
<i>Back in those days...</i>

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:31.650
<i>I looked at him like I was looking
at the shiny, glittering sea.</i>

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:50.570
<i>Stupid!</i>

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:53.840
<i>Why am I blushing
over these memories?!</i>

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:55.070
Oh...

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.190
Your face is red.
Do you have a fever?

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:07.120
A fever?

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:11.100
That's right...
My body feels so achy...

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:15.100
Now you've turned pale.
How interesting...

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.360
<i>It's because you're too close!</i>

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.310
I'm fine! Don't worry about me.

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:37.850
Your foot...

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.080
Oh... I'm sorry!

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:42.990
I can see your panties.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:54.330
That was close.
You almost hit your head.

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:37.340
Ouch!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.440
Stupid! Don't look at me like that.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:35.030
<i>I really am stupid...</i>

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:39.000
<i>Something's wrong...
Something's wrong with me!</i>

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.340
<i>What am I doing?!</i>

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:05.480
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:10.230
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:19.700
Some day, the whole world

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:25.510
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:33.260
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:38.880
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:45.500
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:51.900
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:58.800
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:58.800 --> 00:23:07.680
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:15.590
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:15.590 --> 00:23:21.650
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:28.910
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:32.300
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:38.170
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:51.190
Domyoji has Shigeru...

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:53.330
They make a perfect pair.

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:57.100
I hurt him
with my thoughtless words.

00:23:57.630 --> 00:24:03.270
I think God is telling me to give it up,
and to help her out.

00:24:04.110 --> 00:24:06.840
Hana Yori Dango:
"The Turning of Love's Tide"

00:24:07.310 --> 00:24:09.310
Congratulations, Shigeru...
